        "subject": "LU-4009 osd-zfs: Fix compile errors due to zfs version",
        "message": "LU-4009 osd-zfs: Fix compile errors due to zfs version\n\nlr_write_t has no lr_data member in old zfs version, such as 0.8.3.\nInstead, use (lr + 1) to access the data portion.\n\nzil_open has 2 parameters.\n\nuse enum zio_flag instead of zio_flag_t.\n\nThere is one link error: arc_buf_destroy() is not exported by ZFS.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignored\nSigned-off-by: Caifeng Zhu <caifeng_zhu@163.com>\nChange-Id: I87dba03832ece93aa4ee13b7eb95588c28cf54ce\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/b2_16"
    }
